        "ontologyDescriptionCore": "The eProcurement Ontology eCatalogue module describes the concepts and properties representing the Electronic Catalogue domain. The provision of these semantics offers the basis for a common understanding of the domain for all stakeholders ensuring the quality of data exchange and transparency. The ontology restrictions are published in a separate artefact.",
        "ontologyDescriptionRestrictions": "The eProcurement Ontology eCatalogue restrictions provides the restrictions and the inference-related specifications on the concepts and properties in the eProcurement Ontology eCatalogue module.",
